@*
    Inline SVG sprite, rendered once by _Layout. Views draw an icon with:

        <svg class="hgd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#hgd-icon-sun" /></svg>

    Outline icons are from Feather (MIT) and take their colour from `currentColor`.
    Brand marks (Google, GitHub) keep their own colours. Add a <symbol> here instead of
    pasting SVG into pages, so every icon stays consistent and themeable.
*@
